# Local Rust build artefacts (regenerated by `python rust_things/build_rust_kernels.py`).
target/
*.lock
# Note: Cargo.lock IS *not* in this list — it should be committed (the
# crate is a binary, and committing the lockfile pins dependency
# versions so every contributor's build is byte-identical).
!Cargo.lock

# We DO commit the compiled extensions under bin/<platform_arch>/ so
# end users don't have to rebuild.  Don't auto-ignore them.
